{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_01_010_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:ec7dc0316fe17f16cbcf4b7cb653c62e53b181b91bdf3a318230ce6b839ca01a",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_01_010_22:5_01_010_22_a:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7a5b2ea229f72096e95aa19eb57b7cff84444c40143be73827bbec58950c82d4",
      "text": "哇啊……！这个巧克力，是给我的吗？谢谢你，●●●●プロデューサー！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_010_22:5_01_010_22_a:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:76a814decc26f88dde2ec0cca59619e20c59af7295849d9c227c531e2ea32cba",
      "text": "我听说，情人节收到的巧克力里，装满了最喜欢的心意！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_010_22:5_01_010_22_a:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d75dde30a24bf8f29f6d7acaf5f092d8ce9555d6569e67748c9363741f5a0035",
      "text": "制作人，喜欢我吗？好开心！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_010_22:5_01_010_22_a:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7a54c8f7559e87119b4402030cd3261e6f154fc6cd02c6e5bf83c87a83841d42",
      "text": "我听说，3月要为情人节回礼！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_010_22:5_01_010_22_a:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b7339a15cf292a150bee606a15c8679a1d6cc29df2ac593ce92be737f40cf957",
      "text": "我会准备很棒的东西。等着我哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_010_22:5_01_010_22_b:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bf53fcf4e4e6fcbe35c5240ba03179c7614bae21c5e35052c3199c30cf4a988f",
      "text": "呀呼——！●●●●プロデューサー，谢谢你的巧克力！连蛙埃尔的份都有！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_010_22:5_01_010_22_b:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:18980768732eaf1dd2c30011a93c864af2e6e87546bbf6137192dd0d568c8ba8",
      "text": "情人节，是送巧克力给最喜欢的人的日子。实告诉我的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_010_22:5_01_010_22_b:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c33db233c40469e64c922aeb7e3387498555e52732bae43f87f90383384f76b",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，喜欢我和蛙埃尔吗？我说得对吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_010_22:5_01_010_22_b:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:04e65a7901ecec5af2bf82a895fb944b9ed3019d519165653685c76103da09c0",
      "text": "我也最喜欢●●●●プロデューサー了！欸嘿嘿，我们一样呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_010_22:5_01_010_22_b:cmd-000030:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c6b7be887fd55ba20b02b3dbf68199147c88563718a04449e6bb09579ec7eeed",
      "text": "心意能传达到太好了",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_010_22:5_01_010_22_b:cmd-000031:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7f369d53789455730d69ecccb76befd424944568e36394be74c9843d85f0df77",
      "text": "皮埃尔先生能开心太好了",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_010_22:5_01_010_22_b:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:51b980fa66b6d3681b9cb29cfc9ebbfe1dd7ba65352ab31099f9b22a0d63410c",
      "text": "欸嘿嘿，我好Happy♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_010_22:5_01_010_22_b:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8c5b2bd13f2ea66ad97a204d3edc65131f36eb9431d5a41bd16a77299634afe0",
      "text": "嗯♪ 我非常开心！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_010_22:5_01_010_22_b:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ca6842f57da97d2ce46179beee7ce2a74e172f2e0c601222dbd23a9ef0df9690",
      "text": "啊，对了！实告诉了我白色情人节的事。那是为情人节回礼的日子。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_010_22:5_01_010_22_b:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e5ced5e75cf1a948b23118b57af4466fa601352a76b620701626d92e636edb4f",
      "text": "我会准备珍藏的特别回礼。 ●●●●プロデューサー，好好期待哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
